{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261117/photo/bkn-20261117083800480-1117_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261117111741\"/><p>現場為悅屏樓。</p><p>今晨(17日)7時44分，元朗朗屏邨悅屏樓一單位，一名姓林(36歲)女住戶在寓所內暈倒，由母親發現報案。救援人員趕至現場，當場證實事主已氣絕身亡。警員調查後，列作「屍體發現」處理，事主死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T03:27:21.902533+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T00:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:26:30.494926+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T03:20:59.884588+00:00","content_hash":"2c794092ee911088d1a7e16768f52d4553ef706fa9d912abe75bd5a5bf8575f0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}